			<div class="content" id="post-content-2775456">
									

<p>A collaborative effort between myself, Joreth, and ARandomDay. Significant props to my homies, this literally would not have happened without them.</p>
<p>To everyone who gave this one a look over, thank you. Specifically, Silber, Jekeled, Decibelle, minmin, TyGently, TheRaven, Weizhong, WestyDude, AidenEldritch, and so many others.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Hey&nbsp;djkaktus,&nbsp;I&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;question&nbsp;about...</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
