<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The eel is a creature that deconstructs cognition, and destroys consciousness. Memory, thought, it all gets lost in the wash and those who are affected are left with nothing. However, some things may creep in to fill that void, memories they never experienced, dreams they never had, and sometimes, things they never said.</p>
<p>From where those come, who can say.</p>
</div>
